    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）某企业2023年开始拓展海外业务，当年海外业务亏损m元，但2024年海外业务实现利润2m元。在国内市场每年利润保持不变的前提下，2024年总利润是2023年的1.2倍。问该企业每年国内市场利润为多少元？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "13m"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "14m"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "15m"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "16m"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          87
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          81
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-05-p087.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第81页",
            "pdfPage": 87
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设每年国内利润P。2023海外亏m，总利润P－m；2024海外赚2m，总利润P＋2m。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "P＋2m＝1.2(P－m)，整理0.2P＝3.2m，所以P＝16m，选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "亏损带负号，增长倍数比较的是两年总利润。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
