    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23国考）商店销售某种商品，打八折销售时卖2件的利润与按定价销售时卖1件的利润相同，相当于降价120元／件销售时卖3件的利润。问该商品的定价为多少元/件？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "360"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "450"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "540"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "720"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          87
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          81
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-06-p087.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第81页",
            "pdfPage": 87
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设定价P、成本C。八折卖2件与原价卖1件利润相同，2(0.8P－C)＝P－C，得C＝0.6P。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "原价1件利润0.4P；降120元卖3件的利润3(P－120－0.6P)也等于0.4P。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "整理1.2P－360＝0.4P，得到P＝450元，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "多个利润相等条件逐次利用，先求成本占定价的比例再解实际价格。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
