    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第7题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）某种商品在定价基础上打八折销售，打折之前每天卖40件，开始打折第一天起，每天都比前一天多卖10件。打折销售15天的利润总额与打折之前销售20天的利润总额相同，问这种商品的成本是定价的：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "60%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "64%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "70%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "75%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          87,
          88
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          81,
          82
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07-p087.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷7 · 讲义第81页",
            "pdfPage": 87
          },
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07-p088.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷7 · 讲义第82页",
            "pdfPage": 88
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-07",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先算打折后的总销量。第一天就比原来的40件多10件，是50件；第15天190件，15天合计(50＋190)×15÷2＝1800件。原先20天卖800件。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "设定价P、成本C，总利润相等：1800(0.8P－C)＝800(P－C)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "整理640P＝1000C，得到C/P＝64%，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "打折首日的销量已经增长一次，等差求和的首项要从50开始。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
