    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26河南事考）一种商品第1天按定价销售，利润为n元／件。往后每天都降价0.1n元／件销售，第14天正好卖完。已知每天均卖出m件，14天总销售额正好相当于定价打七五折卖完所有商品。则这种商品成本为（）元／件。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1.2n"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1.5n"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1.6n"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1.8n"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          88
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          82
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-08-p088.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第82页",
            "pdfPage": 88
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设定价P。第1天售价P，此后每天降0.1n，第14天售价P－1.3n。每天销量相同，全部商品的平均售价就是这14个等差售价的平均：P－0.65n。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "平均售价相当于定价七五折，所以P－0.65n＝0.75P，得到P＝2.6n。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "第1天利润是n，成本＝P－n＝1.6n，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "每天销量相同才可直接平均每天售价，14天对应13次降价。"
        }
      ],
